com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/65cec39a-7ae0-4aa6-914d-03137153f8c9.__CR0,0,970,600_PT0_SX970_V1___.jpg\" class=\"a-spacing-base\" data-src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/65cec39a-7ae0-4aa6-914d-03137153f8c9.__CR0,0,970,600_PT0_SX970_V1___.jpg\"\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003ch3 class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003eBUTTON-HOLD FUNCTION\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"a-spacing-base\"\u003eIf you long press the ZL button once, a constant hold of the button will be simulated so that you can drag items behind you.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"celwidget aplus-module 3p-module-b aplus-standard\" cel_widget_id=\"aplus-m-3p-module-b\" data-csa-c-id=\"74esgb-korz3t-gvyfvp-i4doi1\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"aplus-3p-center-content\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"Pedals\" src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/c9701e53-6006-40d3-83a6-345caaf948cb.__CR0,0,970,600_PT0_SX970_V1___.jpg\" class=\"a-spacing-base\" data-src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/c9701e53-6006-40d3-83a6-345caaf948cb.__CR0,0,970,600_PT0_SX970_V1___.jpg\"\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003ch3 class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003eFully Operated Paddles and Pedals\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"a-spacing-base\"\u003eBring the game to life and take down your rivals\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"celwidget aplus-module 3p-module-b aplus-standard\" cel_widget_id=\"aplus-m-3p-module-b\" data-csa-c-id=\"fbwsiy-5xuyij-l01f72-f3c637\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"aplus-3p-center-content\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"Assign Button  Function\" src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/b2c8f5d7-27a6-4822-8365-aee3b2dccaa3.__CR0,0,970,600_PT0_SX970_V1___.jpg\" class=\"a-spacing-base\" data-src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/b2c8f5d7-27a6-4822-8365-aee3b2dccaa3.__CR0,0,970,600_PT0_SX970_V1___.jpg\"\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003ch3 class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003eAssign Button Function\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"a-spacing-base\"\u003eCustomize your Wheel by assigning buttons\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"celwidget aplus-module 3p-module-b aplus-standard\" cel_widget_id=\"aplus-m-3p-module-b\" data-csa-c-id=\"a2vees-wzi1u3-uc7wxt-q6p2fh\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"aplus-3p-center-content\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"Deluxe and Mini\" src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/5ecbfad2-161d-403e-b903-c859998cd01c.__CR0,0,970,600_PT0_SX970_V1___.jpg\" class=\"a-spacing-base\" data-src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/5ecbfad2-161d-403e-b903-c859998cd01c.__CR0,0,970,600_PT0_SX970_V1___.jpg\"\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"a-cardui feature\" data-a-card-type=\"basic\" name=\"a-cardui-deck-autoname-4-card1\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"productDescription_feature_div\" data-feature-name=\"productDescription\" data-template-name=\"productDescription\" class=\"a-section a-spacing-none\"\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eDescription\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"productDescription_fullView\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"a-section text-direction-override\" dir=\"auto\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eHORI is pleased to announce the Nintendo Switch Mario Kart Racing Wheel Pro. This larger deluxe version of the racing wheel is ideal for the Mario Kart and racing gamer. The ergonomic wheel design, pedals, and convenient onboard controls were built to create an authentic racing simulation. Officially licensed by Nintendo.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"a-cardui feature\" data-a-card-type=\"basic\" name=\"a-cardui-deck-autoname-4-card2\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"featureBulletsAndDetailBullet