 for Nintendo Switch - Compatible with all Nintendo Switch Models","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePlay while charging at the perfect angle! sturdy and stable with cooling air vents. Great to use with Controller pads. Folds up for portability, with Game Cards Slorage\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"iPlay","offers":[{"title":"Mario Mushroom Ed.","offer_id":45992094957790,"sku":null,"price":7.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true},{"title":"Pokemon Ed.","offer_id":45992094990558,"sku":null,"price":7.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true},{"title":"Zelda Black Ed.","offer_id":45992095023326,"sku":null,"price":7.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true},{"title":"Pikachu Ed.","offer_id":45992095056094,"sku":null,"price":7.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true},{"title":"Luigi Ed.","offer_id":45992095088862,"sku":null,"price":7.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true},{"title":"Mario Yellow Ed.","offer_id":45992095121630,"sku":null,"price":7.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true},{"title":"Mario Red Ed.","offer_id":45992095154398,"sku":null,"price":7.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true},{"title":"Splatoon Ed.","offer_id":45992095187166,"sku":null,"price":7.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true},{"title":"Zelda Blue Ed.","offer_id":45992095219934,"sku":null,"price":7.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true},{"title":"Animal Crossing Ed.","offer_id":45992095252702,"sku":null,"price":7.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true},{"title":"Pokemon Arceus Ed.","offer_id":45992095285470,"sku":null,"price":7.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0272\/9476\/1037\/files\/PhotoGrid-Plus_1730148301677.jpg?v=1730148333"},{"product_id":"nintendo-switch-2-protective-carrying-case-storage-bag-full-black","title":"Nintendo Switch 2 Protective Carrying Case , Storage Bag - Full Black","description":"\u003cp\u003e1.Comprehensive Protection: Incorporating high- quality materials, offers shockproof, scratchproof, and waterproof features to safeguard the console from external damage.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e2. Inner Cushioning: The soft inner lining design prevents scratches or impacts on the console and its accessories during transportation.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e3. Lightweight and Portable: Compactly designed for easy carrying, making it ideal for travel or outdoor use,.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e4. Extra Pockets: Includes additional pockets for\u003cbr\u003estoring small accessories like headphones, Game Cards and\u003cbr\u003echarging cables.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e5. High-Quality Fabric: Made with wear-resistant and waterproof fabric, ensuring durability for\u003cbr\u003elong-term use.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"iPlay","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":46888922743006,"sku":"","price":10.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0272\/9476\/1037\/files\/rn-image_picker_lib_temp_0baee467-e634-4a4c-ae71-6433826e9155.jpg?v=1748636472"},{"product_id":"nintendo-switch-2-carrying-case","title":"Nintendo Switch™ 2 Carrying Case","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eThe Nintendo Switch 2 Carrying Case is designed to keep your console protected and organized while you’re on the move. It provides a convenient way to store the Nintendo Switch 2 and essential accessories, helping to guard against everyday dust, minor bumps, and scratches. Compact and easy to carry, this case is suitable for travel, commuting, or simple storage at home, making it a practical companion for Nintendo Switch 2 users.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"iPlay","offers":[{"title":"Black","offer_id":46892587057374,"sku":null,"price":8.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true},{"title":"Blue","offer_id":46892587090142,"sku":null,"price":8.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true},{"title":"Red","offer_id":46892587122910,"sku":null,"price":8.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true},{"title":"Pink","offer_id":46892587155678,"sku":null,"price":8.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true},{"title":"White","offer_id":46892587188446,"sku":null,"price":8.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0272\/9476\/1037\/files\/rn-image_picker_lib_temp_4feadf9d-5489-487b-9a53-33621215a36d.jpg?v=1749677248"},{"product_id":"deluxe-travel-carry-bag-for-nintenfo-switch-2","title":"Deluxe Travel Carry Bag For Nintenfo Switch 2","description":"\u003cp\u003e1. Ultimate Protection: \u003cbr\u003e* Shock-Absorbent Padding: Keeps your Nintendo Switch Joy-Cons, and accessories safe from bumps and drops\u003cbr\u003e* Water-Resistant Material: Protects your device from spills and light rain, ensuring durability on the go.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e2. Compact \u0026amp; Lightweight Design: \u003cbr\u003e* Slim Profile: Fits easily into backpacks or luggage without adding bulk.\u003cbr\u003e* Lightweight Construction: Perfect for travel, commuting or everyday use.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e3.Smart Storage Solutions:\u003cbr\u003eDedicated Compartments: Organized spaces for your console, games, cables, and power adapter.\u003cbr\u003e* Mesh Pocket: Keeps smaller accessories like earphones or SD cards secure and easily accessible\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e4. Premium Quality \u0026amp; Style:\u003cbr\u003e* Durable Fabric: Made with high-quality materials for long- lasting use\u003cbr\u003e* Sleek Aesthetic: Modern design available in multiple colors to match your style.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e5. Portable \u0026amp; Convenient:\u003cbr\u003e* Comfortable Handle \u0026amp; Adjustable Strap: Carry it by hand or wear it crossbody for hands-free convenience,\u003cbr\u003e* Quick Access Zipper: Easily open and close the bag to grab your Switch in seconds.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e6. Perfect for Gamers on the Go:\u003cbr\u003e* Travel-Friendly: Designed to meet airline carry-on requirements, making it ideal for trips.\u003cbr\u003e* All-in-One Solution: Everything you need in one compact bag for gaming anywhere, anytime.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"KJH","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":46893621149918,"sku":"","price":20.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0272\/9476\/1037\/files\/rn-image_picker_lib_temp_2018671e-f9fd-4d67-a791-014fa5bebb81.jpg?v=1748643961"},{"product_id":"travel-carrying-case-for-nintendo-switch-2","title":"Travel Carrying Case For Nintendo Switch 2","description":"\u003cp\u003e1.Comprehensive Protection: Incorporating high- quality materials, offers shockproof, scratchproof, and waterproof features to safeguard the console from external damage.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e2. Inner Cushioning: The soft inner lining design prevents scratches or impacts on the console and its accessories during transportation.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e3. Lightweight and Portable: Compactly designed for easy carrying, making it ideal for travel or outdoor use,.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e4. Extra Pockets: Includes additional pockets for\u003cbr\u003estoring small accessories like headphones, Game Cards and\u003cbr\u003echarging cables.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e5. High-Quality Fabric: Made with wear-resistant and waterproof fabric, ensuring durability for\u003cbr\u003elong-term use.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"KJH","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":46929773986014,"sku":"","price":8.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0272\/9476\/1037\/files\/rn-image_picker_lib_temp_9639a0d2-b3a7-4bfa-8e33-a48dfd7e7987.jpg?v=1748705618"},{"product_id":"9-in-1-protective-kit-for-nintendo-switch-2","title":"9 in 1 Protective Kit For Nintendo Switch 2","description":"\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 Protective Carrying Case\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eConsole \u0026amp; Controllers Crystal Case\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e4 thumb Grips\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eGlass Screen Protector\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e1.Comprehensive Protection: Incorporating high- quality materials, offers shockproof, scratchproof, and waterproof features to safeguard the console from external damage.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e2. Inner Cushioning: The soft inner lining design prevents scratches or impacts on the console and its accessories during transportation.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e3. Lightweight and Portable: Compactly designed for easy carrying, making it ideal for travel or outdoor use,.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e4. Extra Pockets: Includes additional pockets for\u003cbr\u003estoring small accessories like headphones, Game Cards and\u003cbr\u003echarging cables.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e5. High-Quality Fabric: Made with wear-resistant and waterproof fabric, ensuring durability for\u003cbr\u003elong-term use.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"KJH","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":46930531287262,"sku":null,"price":15.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0272\/9476\/1037\/files\/rn-image_picker_lib_temp_e32c257a-27e0-4135-bafa-1dc4ca42c0dd.png?v=1748705618"},{"product_id":"tempered-glass-screen-protector-for-nintendo-switch-2","title":"Tempered Glass Screen Protector For Nintendo Switch 2","description":"\u003cul class=\"a-unordered-list a-vertical a-spacing-none\"\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eThe high definition tempered finish is ultra responsive as well as resistant to oil smudges and fingerprint markings.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eFeatures a tough-as-nails true 9H hardness rating with dual tempered layering and reinforced shatterproof construction.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eEasy Installation: Includes alignment guide, enabling a precise, bubble-free application\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Lucky Fox","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":46985957933278,"sku":"","price":5.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0272\/9476\/1037\/files\/rn-image_picker_lib_temp_56c9bbd1-170b-47e1-989c-159695cc7c6e.jpg?v=1748901331"},{"product_id":"silicone-back-cover-for-nintendo-switch-2","title":"Silicone Back Cover For Nintendo Switch 2","description":"\u003cp\u003eProtect your Nintendo Switch 2 from drops and scratches that are almost guaranteed to happen with a device as portable as this.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"iPlay","offers":[{"title":"Black","offer_id":46985977266398,"sku":null,"price":5.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true},{"title":"Red","offer_id":46985977299166,"sku":null,"price":5.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true},{"title":"Blue","offer_id":46985977331934,"sku":null,"price":5.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0272\/9476\/1037\/files\/rn-image_picker_lib_temp_62adde1d-952c-4f7a-9e1c-c099c2ed95d5.jpg?v=1748901818"},{"product_id":"nintendo-switch-2-console","title":"Nintendo Switch 2 Console","description":"\u003cul class=\"a-unordered-list a-vertical a-spacing-none\"\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eThe next evolution of the Nintendo Switch console is here!\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eExperience new, exclusive games like Mario Kart World only on Nintendo Switch 2. Plus, you can enjoy compatible games from your Nintendo Switch library*. Bring games to life with a larger 1080p screen—or connect to a TV and play in up to 4K resolution**. Support for HDR, VRR, and frame rates up to 120 fps let you enjoy vivid colour, clarity, and smooth gameplay.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eSnap the new Joy-Con 2 controllers into place with magnetic connectors. Each controller can even be used as a mouse in compatible games. Say \"hello\" to GameChat*** - Start a chat with friends at any time using the C Button!\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eShare your game screen while chatting to show what you're up to. And for a more personal touch, connect face-to-face with the Nintendo Switch 2 camera or other compatible USB-C camera (each sold separately). *Some Nintendo Switch games may not be supported or fully compatible with Nintendo Switch 2. \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003e**TV and game must be compatible with 4K resolution. Frame rates are capped at 60 fps for 4K output. ***Additional games, systems and\/or accessories may be required for multiplayer mode. Internet, Nintendo Switch Online membership and Nintendo Account required for online features, including GameChat. Nintendo Switch 2 camera or compatible USB-C camera required for video features. Not available in all countries. Terms and GameChat requirements apply. Games, systems, membership, and some accessories sold separately.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Nintendo","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":46998718546142,"sku":"","price":500.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0272\/9476\/1037\/files\/rn-image_picker_lib_temp_7324a5cb-a89c-4c52-8b33-e4ea04275f29.jpg?v=1749293528"},{"product_id":"yakuza-0-director-s-cut-nintendo-switch-2","title":"Yakuza 0: Director’s Cut - Nintendo Switch 2","description":"\u003cdiv class=\"a-cardui feature\" data-a-card-type=\"basic\" name=\"a-cardui-deck-autoname-6-card1\" data-cel-widget=\"\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"aplus_feature