\"aplus_feature_div\" data-feature-name=\"aplus\" data-template-name=\"aplus\" class=\"a-section a-spacing-none\"\u003e\n\u003ch3 class=\"hoc-feature-heading\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"Cyberpunk 2077 Ultimate Edition Nintendo Switch 2 video game\" src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/b1b23bcb-f76f-417b-b93e-b2233eecc047.__CR0,0,970,300_PT0_SX970_V1___.png\" class=\"a-spacing-mini\" data-src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/b1b23bcb-f76f-417b-b93e-b2233eecc047.__CR0,0,970,300_PT0_SX970_V1___.png\"\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"aplus-v2 mobile celwidget\" cel_widget_id=\"m-aplus\" data-csa-c-id=\"5v8w12-tc4hf-ar1q5a-jqpfig\" data-cel-widget=\"m-aplus\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"celwidget aplus-module module-11 aplus-standard\" cel_widget_id=\"aplus-m-module-11\" data-csa-c-id=\"j3hnbm-qvmita-apxb7p-8i0jm6\" data-cel-widget=\"aplus-m-module-11\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"aplus-module-wrapper\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"a-section a-spacing-none a-text-center\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"Cyberpunk 2077 Ultimate Edition Nintendo Switch 2 video game\" src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/4a47adb1-7108-4ec8-bbc5-e8b4f8fbf6f4.__CR0,0,970,300_PT0_SX970_V1___.png\" class=\"a-spacing-mini\" data-src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/4a47adb1-7108-4ec8-bbc5-e8b4f8fbf6f4.__CR0,0,970,300_PT0_SX970_V1___.png\"\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"celwidget aplus-module module-11 aplus-standard\" cel_widget_id=\"aplus-m-module-11\" data-csa-c-id=\"alm4am-h7ddrm-nhayqu-c8fy4t\" data-cel-widget=\"aplus-m-module-11\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"aplus-module-wrapper\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"a-section a-spacing-none a-text-center\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"Cyberpunk 2077 Ultimate Edition Nintendo Switch 2 video game\" src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/8a08779d-60cc-4438-b56f-df3afa24ea53.__CR0,0,970,300_PT0_SX970_V1___.png\" class=\"a-spacing-mini\" data-src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/8a08779d-60cc-4438-b56f-df3afa24ea53.__CR0,0,970,300_PT0_SX970_V1___.png\"\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"celwidget aplus-module module-11 aplus-standard\" cel_widget_id=\"aplus-m-module-11\" data-csa-c-id=\"5o8a1n-qohvf5-uecaib-vzw54x\" data-cel-widget=\"aplus-m-module-11\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"aplus-module-wrapper\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"a-section a-spacing-none a-text-center\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"Cyberpunk 2077 Ultimate Edition Nintendo Switch 2 video game\" src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/a69ef7b0-020f-4fa4-817a-9283f2b76f2f.__CR0,0,970,300_PT0_SX970_V1___.png\" class=\"a-spacing-mini\" data-src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/a69ef7b0-020f-4fa4-817a-9283f2b76f2f.__CR0,0,970,300_PT0_SX970_V1___.png\"\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"celwidget aplus-module module-11 aplus-standard\" cel_widget_id=\"aplus-m-module-11\" data-csa-c-id=\"hsz7k-1zcvf8-2inhsv-60y9fb\" data-cel-widget=\"aplus-m-module-11\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"aplus-module-wrapper\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"a-section a-spacing-none a-text-center\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"Cyberpunk 2077 Ultimate Edition Nintendo Switch 2 video game\" src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/ae0d2cfb-dc8c-4baf-9dd7-03027bf1f807.__CR0,0,970,300_PT0_SX970_V1___.png\" class=\"a-spacing-mini\" data-src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/ae0d2cfb-dc8c-4baf-9dd7-03027bf1f807.__CR0,0,970,300_PT0_SX970_V1___.png\"\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e","brand":"Nintendo","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":46999019487454,"sku":"","price":60.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0272\/9476\/1037\/files\/rn-image_picker_lib_temp_b405317e-2973-44b8-b946-183b7d8ae73d.jpg?v=1749322017"},{"product_id":"hogwarts-legacy-nintendo-switch-2","title":"Hogwarts Legacy - Nintendo Switch 2","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eThis edition of Hogwarts Legacy has been enhanced for Nintendo Switch 2, including Joy-Con 2 mouse sensor support, improved graphics, audio, load times, and controls. Hogwarts Legacy is an immersive, open-world action RPG set in the world first introduced in the Harry Potter books. Take control of the action and be at the center of your own adventure in the wizarding world. Experience Hogwarts in the 1800s. Make allies, battle Dark wizards, and ultimately decide the fate of the wizarding world. Your legacy is what you make of it. Live the Unwritten. EXPLORE AN OPEN WORLD: The wizarding world awaits you. Freely roam Hogwarts, Hogsmeade, the Forbidden Forest, and the surrounding Overland area. BE THE WITCH OR WIZARD YOU WANT TO BE: Learn spells, brew potions, grow plants, and tend to magical beasts along your journey. Get sorted into your house, forge relationships, and master skills to become the witch or wizard you want to be. EXPERIENCE A NEW WIZARDING WORLD STORY: Experience the wizarding world in a forgotten era to uncover a hidden truth from its past. Battle against trolls, dark wizards, and more as you face a dangerous villain threatening the fate of the wizarding world.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"WB Games","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":46999022141662,"sku":"","price":50.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0272\/9476\/1037\/files\/rn-image_picker_lib_temp_b68e431b-84ed-4b67-929f-ce3f137e2bb7.jpg?v=1749322340"},{"product_id":"sonic-x-shadow-generations-nintendo-switch-2","title":"Sonic X Shadow Generations - Nintendo Switch 2","description":"\u003cdiv class=\"a-cardui feature\" data-a-card-type=\"basic\" name=\"a-cardui-deck-autoname-7-card1\" data-cel-widget=\"\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"productDescription_feature_div\" data-feature-name=\"productDescription\" data-template-name=\"productDescription\" class=\"a-section a-spacing-none\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"productDescription_fullView\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"a-section text-direction-override\" dir=\"auto\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eSONIC AND SHADOW FOR A NEW GENERATION: Shadow the Hedgehog is back with Classic and Modern Sonic in SONIC X SHADOW GENERATIONS, an all-new collection featuring two unique experiences, enahnced and optimized for the Nintendo Switch 2!\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"a-cardui feature\" data-a-card-type=\"basic\" name=\"a-cardui-deck-autoname-7-card2\" data-cel-widget=\"\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"featureBulletsAndDetailBullets_feature_div\" data-feature-name=\"featureBulletsAndDetailBullets\" data-template-name=\"featureBulletsAndDetailBullets\" class=\"a-section a-spacing-none\"\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eFeatures \u0026amp; details\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"featurebullets_secondary_view_div\" class=\"a-section\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"feature-bullets\" class=\"a-section a-spacing-small featureBulletsDiv\"\u003e\n\u003cul class=\"a-unordered-list a-vertical a-spacing-none\"\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003ePast meets present in SONIC GENERATIONS! Modern and Classic Sonic team up to defeat Dr. Eggman and the Time Eater to restore their timeline to normal!\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eSpin dash through a greatest-hits collection of 3D and 2D versions of iconic stages from past Sonic games, now with updated visuals and reworked cinematics\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eIn this new standalone campaign, Black Doom has reemerged and threatens to take over the world. Shadow must journey into his past, confront his memories, and unlock new dark powers to save the world.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eHarness Shadow's new Doom Powers to battle hordes of enemies and tackle platforming challenges like never before. Surf on water, fly over obstacles, and stop time with the return of Chaos Control!\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003ePre-order bonus: Customers who pre-order will receive the Sonic Adventure Legacy Skin and Gerald Robotnik's Journal, a 28-page logbook chronicling Gerald's innermost thoughts and drawings while he created Shadow the Hedgehog and the Ark Space Station.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e","brand":"SEGA","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":46999047897310,"sku":"","price":38.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0272\/9476\/1037\/files\/rn-image_picker_lib_temp_508ef52a-4e25-403b-a774-e231d0a28ebb.jpg?v=1749322972"},{"product_id":"mario-kart-world-nintendo-switch-2","title":"Mario Kart World - Nintendo Switch 2","description":"","brand":"Nintendo","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":47007023038686,"sku":"","price":65.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0272\/9476\/1037\/files\/rn-image_picker_lib_temp_0501ed86-09e6-47df-8106-23a40b06141f.jpg?v=1749648759"},{"product_id":"the-legend-of-zelda-breath-of-the-wild-nintendo-switch-2-edition","title":"The Legend of Zelda: Breath of the Wild - Nintendo Switch 2 Edition","description":"\u003cdiv class=\"a-cardui feature\" data-a-card-type=\"basic\" name=\"a-cardui-deck-autoname-2-card1\" data-cel-widget=\"\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"productDescription_feature_div\" data-feature-name=\"productDescription\" data-template-name=\"productDescription\" class=\"a-section a-spacing-none\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"productDescription_fullView\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"a-section text-direction-override\" dir=\"auto\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eThe Legend of Zelda: Breath of the Wild – Nintendo Switch 2 Edition\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eUpgrade details\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eSupport for the ZELDA NOTES game-specific service via Nintendo Switch App\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eImproved frame rates and resolution\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eFaster load times\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eHDR support\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eNintendo Account, persistent internet and compatible smart device required. Data charges may apply.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eHDR-compatible display required when playing in TV mode.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"a-cardui feature\" data-a-card-type=\"basic\" name=\"a-cardui-deck-autoname-2-card2\" data-cel-widget=\"\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"featureBulletsAndDetailBullets_feature_div\" data-feature-name=\"featureBulletsAndDetailBullets\" data-template-name=\"featureBulletsAndDetailBullets\" class=\"a-section a-spacing-none\"\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eFeatures \u0026amp; details\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"featurebullets_secondary_view_div\" class=\"a-section\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"feature-bullets\" class=\"a-section a-spacing-small featureBulletsDiv\"\u003e\n\u003cul class=\"a-unordered-list a-vertical a-spacing-none\"\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eThe Legend of Zelda: Breath of the Wild – Nintendo Switch 2 Edition; upgrade details\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eSupport for the ZELDA NOTES game-specific service via Nintendo Switch App; improved frame rates and resolution; faster load times; HDR support; nintendo Account, persistent internet and compatible smart device required; data charges may apply; HDR-compatible display required when playing in TV mode\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e","brand":"Nintendo","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":47008097370334,"sku":"","price":55.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0272\/9476\/1037\/files\/rn-image_picker_lib_temp_e61efb35-034c-48aa-b77a-d667986fcd54.jpg?v=1749676322"},{"product_id":"the-legend-of-zelda-tears-of-the-kingdom-nintendo-switch-2-edition","title":"The Legend of Zelda: Tears of the Kingdom - Nintendo Switch 2 Edition","description":"\u003cdiv class=\"a-cardui feature\" data-a-card-type=\"basic\" name=\"a-cardui-deck-autoname-2-card1\" data-cel-widget=\"\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"productDescription_feature_div\" data-feature-name=\"productDescription\" data-template-name=\"productDescription\" class=\"a-section a-spacing-none\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"productDescription_fullView\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"a-section text-direction-override\" dir=\"auto\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eThe Legend of Zelda: Tears of the Kingdom – Nintendo Switch 2 Edition\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eUpgrade details\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eSupport for the ZELDA NOTES game-specific service via Nintendo Switch App\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eImproved frame rates and resolution\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eFaster load times\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eHDR support\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eNintendo Account, persistent internet and compatible smart device required. Data charges may apply.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eHDR-compatible display required when playing in TV mode.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"a-cardui feature\" data-a-card-type=\"basic\" name=\"a-cardui-deck-autoname-2-card2\" data-cel-widget=\"\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"featureBulletsAndDetailBullets_feature_div\" data-feature-name=\"featureBulletsAndDetailBullets\" data-template-name=\"featureBulletsAndDetailBullets\" class=\"a-section a-spacing-none\"\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eFeatures \u0026amp; details\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"featurebullets_secondary_view_div\" class=\"a-section\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"feature-bullets\" class=\"a-section a-spacing-small featureBulletsDiv\"\u003e\n\u003cul class=\"a-unordered-list a-vertical a-spacing-none\"\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eThe Legend of Zelda: Tears of the Kingdom – Nintendo Switch 2 Edition\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eUpgrade details\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eSupport for the ZELDA NOTES game-specific service via Nintendo Switch App; improved frame rates and resolution\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eFaster load times; HDR support\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eNintendo Account, persistent internet and compatible smart device required; data charges may apply; HDR-compatible display required when playing in TV mode\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e","brand":"Nintendo","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":47008099795166,"sku":"","price":60.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0272\/9476\/1037\/files\/rn-image_picker_lib_temp_3e08c108-d4a0-4f5e-a7a4-fa505c7dd0d0.jpg?v=1749676570"},{"product_id":"nintendo-switch-2-camera","title":"Nintendo Switch 2 Camera","description":"\u003cul class=\"a-unordered-list a-vertical a-spacing-none\"\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eSay 'hello' to GameChat; it's easy to stay connected with friends and family; feel like you're playing in the same room together, no matter the distance\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eConnect the Nintendo Switch 2 camera to video chat and see your friends' faces while you all play; share your screen in real time, even if you're all playing different games\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eTeam up in the same game or watch along as your friends play different ones; it's all about hanging out and having a good time\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eAll Together, Anytime, Anywhere\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eAdditional games, systems and\/or accessories may be required for multiplayer mode; internet, Nintendo Switch Online membership and Nintendo Account required for online features, including GameChat; nintendo Switch 2 camera or compatible USB-C camera required for video features; not available in all countries; terms and GameChat requirements apply; games, systems, membership, and some accessories sold separately\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Nintendo","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":47010790047966,"sku":"","price":50.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0272\/9476\/1037\/files\/rn-image_picker_lib_temp_a9af0bd8-c1fb-4aab-b8a5-84da589c466d.jpg?v=1749759376"},{"product_id":"nintendo-joy-con-2-pair-light-blue-and-light-red","title":"Nintendo Switch™ 2 Joy-Con™ 2 Pair (L)\/(R) - Light Blue and Light Red","description":"\u003cul class=\"a-unordered-list a-vertical a-spacing-none\"\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eJoy-Con 2 controllers: Left and right Joy-Con 2 controllers; includes two Joy-Con 2 straps; the updated Joy-Con 2 controllers have easy-to-use motion controls and HD rumble 2, along with the new C Button for easy GameChat access and all-new mouse controls in compatible games\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eThis set includes both a left and right Joy-Con 2 controller, along with a pair of Joy-Con 2 straps, for local multiplayer with a friend in compatible games; only for use with Nintendo Switch 2\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eThe Nintendo Switch 2 console comes with one Joy-Con 2 L and one Joy-Con 2 R, and two Joy-Con 2 straps\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Nintendo","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":47035051671774,"sku":"","price":78.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0272\/9476\/1037\/files\/rn-image_picker_lib_temp_bdefef1b-bf68-45e4-ae39-a9e2ce818533.jpg?v=1750798905"},{"product_id":"nintedno-joy-con-2-wheel-pair","title":"Nintedno Joy-Con 2 Wheel - Pair","description":"\u003cp\u003eWork as the Joy-con 2 grip for more confortable holding also a better protection for Joy-cons from bumps and scratches\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSteering wheel gives you a more realistic driving experience when you playing the Switch racing game\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFull access to ports and buttons,provides SL and SR buttons on the top of grip to facilitate your game control\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePacking Included:2*steering wheel grip holders for Joy-cons 2\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Dobe","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":47035060650206,"sku":"","price":8.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0272\/9476\/1037\/files\/rn-image_picker_lib_temp_454707e4-29e4-4d65-b6bb-993492d3cddf.jpg?v=1750799821"},{"product_id":"nintendo-switch-2-controller-grip-pair","title":"Nintendo Switch 2 Controller Grip - Pair","description":"\u003cul class=\"a-unordered-list a-vertical a-spacing-none\"\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eMakes the joy con 2 grips not shake off or slide, not loose and not too tight. Snug fit. Nice solid build.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eEasily place your controller in here and get access to every button.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003ePerfect for those extended, high-stress gaming sessions. Grab control and elevate your game with the FastSnail Grip Kit.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eSince it is a special cover, it can protect your Joy-Con 2 firmly from everyday wear and tear, scratches and dirt.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Dobe","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":47035070415070,"sku":"","price":8.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0272\/9476\/1037\/files\/rn-image_picker_lib_temp_41e186c1-ce50-4724-8d10-fec408abaada.jpg?v=1750800406"},{"product_id":"dobe-silicone-protective-cover-for-nintendo-switch-2","title":"DOBE Silicone Protective Cover For Nintendo Switch 2","description":"\u003cp\u003eFor Nintendo Switch 2 console.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePrecise mold opening, anti-vibration, anti-drop and anti-skid design, effectively protecting your console;\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e1. Material: Silicone\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cspan\u003e2. Made of silicone material, soft and feel good\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cspan\u003e3. The protective shell adopts a one-piece design, anti-skid and anti-drop\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cspan\u003e4. Precise hole design, fit game console\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cspan\u003e5. Anti-slip raised design on the back to prevent the game console from slipping off the hand\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Dobe","offers":[{"title":"Black","offer_id":47035099447518,"sku":null,"price":8.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true},{"title":"Blue","offer_id":47035099480286,"sku":null,"price":8.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true},{"title":"Red","offer_id":47035099513054,"sku":null,"price":8.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true},{"title":"White","offer_id":47035099545822,"sku":"","price":8.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0272\/9476\/1037\/files\/rn-image_picker_lib_temp_0a423fd9-0ce8-4eca-a8de-befd418a3b58.jpg?v=1750801521"},{"product_id":"oivo-fast-magnatic-charging-dock-with-7-light-modes-for-nintendo-switch-2","title":"OIVO Fast Magnatic Charging Dock with 7 Light Modes For Nintendo Switch 2","description":"\u003cul class=\"a-unordered-list a-vertical a-spacing-none\"\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eCompatible with Nintendo Switch 2 Joy-Con 2025 version.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003e4-Port for Fast Charging: The Nintendo Switch 2 charging dock features a unique triangular design that allows you to charge up to 4 Joy-cons controllers at the same time and recharge them in just 2.5 hours. Group play won't cut out, making gameplay more enjoyable.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eMagnetic Quick Charge: Nintendo switch 2 dock features a magnetic charging design that makes it easy to align and securely place the controllers, making Joy-Con charging even more convenient. The LED indicators show the charging status of each Joy Con in real time, with green for fully charged or standby and orange for charging.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003e7 RGB Light Effects: The nintedo switch 2 controller charging dock provides 7 RGB lighting effects, including fast\/slow breathing light, RGB flowing light cycle and 4 monochrome lights (green, white, red, blue). A long press on the RGB button toggles the 7 RGB lighting effects, while a short press turns off the RGB lights and charging indicator. Create an exclusive gaming atmosphere by your own preference.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003ePlug \u0026amp; Play Design: The magnetic design aid allows the Joy-cons controller to be put in easily for more stable charging, and it can also be automatically adsorbed and aligned when placed casually and charged immediately.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eSafe \u0026amp; Reliable: This switch 2 accessories is equipped with a smart protection chip to prevent over-current, overheating, over-voltage and short-circuit, making your Nintendo Switch 2 Joy-Con accessories safer and longer-lasting, perfect gaming gift for your friends and family.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"OIVO","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":47035104690398,"sku":"","price":15.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0272\/9476\/1037\/files\/rn-image_picker_lib_temp_265bc1e5-6cb3-4a3e-84ca-e3045b72fb5e.jpg?v=1750803046"},{"product_id":"street-fighter-6-years-1-2-fighters-edition-nintendo-switch-2","title":"Street Fighter 6 - Years 1-2 - Fighters Edition - Nintendo Switch 2","description":"\u003cdiv class=\"flex text-body-40 text-grey-900\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eExperience the next evolution of Street Fighter in Street Fighter 6 with three distinct game modes, new gameplay features, and enhanced visuals.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"flex text-body-40 text-grey-900\"\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"rounded-full min-w-[5px] min-h-[5px] w-[5px] h-[5px] bg-blue-400 mr-2 mt-2\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003eFight your way to the top with new game modes exclusive to Nintendo Switch 2 like Local Wireless One on One and Avatar Matches. Enjoy new party modes utilising Joy-Con 2 controllers like Gyro Battle and Calorie Contest.\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"flex text-body-40 text-grey-900\"\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"rounded-full min-w-[5px] min-h-[5px] w-[5px] h-[5px] bg-blue-400 mr-2 mt-2\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003ePlus, players can check out three new amiibo figures and 22 amiibo cards at launch (sold seperatley)\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"flex text-body-40 text-grey-900\"\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"rounded-full min-w-[5px] min-h-[5px] w-[5px] h-[5px] bg-blue-400 mr-2 mt-2\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003eDigital Download File size\/s: 50GB Additional storage may be needed on your console for installation or software updates.\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e","brand":"Nintendo","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":47038651236574,"sku":"","price":55.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0272\/9476\/1037\/files\/rn-image_picker_lib_temp_fe946403-d862-47b3-bc47-7878c53ba999.jpg?v=1750969242"},{"product_id":"nintendo-switch-2-pro-controller","title":"Nintendo Switch 2 Pro Controller","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eTake your gaming to the next level with the Nintendo Switch™ 2 Pro Controller. Features include: • HD Rumble 2 • Motion controls • Built-in amiibo™ functionality* • Capture Button • C Button for GameChat** • Programmable GL\/GR buttons • Audio jack *amiibo not included. **Internet, Nintendo Account and Nintendo Switch Online membership (sold separately) required for GameChat. Not available in all countries.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Nintendo","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":47059111706846,"sku":null,"price":78.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0272\/9476\/1037\/files\/rn-image_picker_lib_temp_f4d04866-09f6-473b-8d7d-30e9e09b116f.jpg?v=1751828764"},{"product_id":"sandisk-microsd-express-card-256gb-for-nintendo-switch-2","title":"SanDisk microSD Express Card 256GB for Nintendo Switch 2","description":"\u003cul class=\"features\"\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"feature\"\u003eWith write speeds up to 650MB\/s and read speeds up to 880MB\/s, you can download, load, and play games without wasting precious seconds. Sustained write speeds of 210MB\/s enable high-resolution video capture of your gameplay.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"feature\"\u003eSanDisk ThermAdapt technology helps keep operating temperatures within safe limits with a specially designed enclosure and controller that uses dynamic adaptive thermal management.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"SanDisk","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":47080822112478,"sku":null,"price":60.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0272\/9476\/1037\/files\/rn-image_picker_lib_temp_f47a78bf-29df-433e-9dae-f8f252563119.jpg?v=1752611286"},{"product_id":"donkey-kong-bananza-nintendo-switch-2","title":"Donkey Kong Bananza - Nintendo Switch 2","description":"\u003cul class=\"a-unordered-list a-vertical a-spacing-none\"\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eExplore a vast underground world—by smashing your way through it!\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eA brand-new 3D platforming action adventure starring Donkey Kong and Pauline\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eBash through just about anything in groundbreaking exploration! Crash through walls and carve tunnels—the more you smash, the more areas open up to you\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003ePair up with Pauline to use Bananza Transformations: smash through obstacles with the raw strength of Kong form, gallop with incredible speed as a Zebra, and more\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eTeam up with a friend in two-player co-op as Donkey Kong and Pauline! Blast foes and terrain alike with Pauline’s voice as you explore together\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eRace against Void Kong, leader of the greedy VoidCo, to get to the bananas at the planet core\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eInterested in the Donkey Kong Bananza game?! Save* up to $29.99 on a Nintendo Switch 2 system bundled with your choice of a full game download for one of the following games exclusive to Nintendo Switch 2: Mario Kart World, Donkey Kong Bananza, or Pokémon Pokopia!\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Nintendo","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":47113112682718,"sku":null,"price":60.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0272\/9476\/1037\/files\/rn-image_picker_lib_temp_f2b87326-5a14-48b7-bd05-6f43d9989a81.jpg?v=1753203025"},{"product_id":"super-mario-party-jamboree-nintendo-switch-2-edition-jamboree-tv","title":"Super Mario Party Jamboree - Nintendo Switch 2 Edition + Jamboree TV","description":"\u003cdiv class=\"a-cardui feature\" data-a-card-type=\"basic\" name=\"a-cardui-deck-autoname-2-card1\" data-cel-widget=\"\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"productDescription_feature_div\" data-feature-name=\"productDescription\" data-template-name=\"productDescription\" class=\"a-section a-spacing-none\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"productDescription_fullView\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"a-section text-direction-override\" dir=\"auto\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eThe biggest Mario party - together, whenever and wherever you want!\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eDiscover unique new modes and mini-games that use mouse mode, the microphone built into the console, and the Nintendo Switch 2 camera (sold separately).\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eInvite friends to the Bowser stage, a game show experience with 2v2 team battles!\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"a-cardui feature\" data-a-card-type=\"basic\" name=\"a-cardui-deck-autoname-2-card2\" data-cel-widget=\"\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"featureBulletsAndDetailBullets_feature_div\" data-feature-name=\"featureBulletsAndDetailBullets\" data-template-name=\"featureBulletsAndDetailBullets\" class=\"a-section a-spacing-none\"\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eFeatures \u0026amp; details\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"featurebullets_secondary_view_div\" class=\"a-section\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"feature-bullets\" class=\"a-section a-spacing-small featureBulletsDiv\"\u003e\n\u003cul class=\"a-unordered-list a-vertical a-spacing-none\"\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eDice and hang the others on the board to collect the most stars. Each of the seven game boards offers its very own world! New rules for Jamboree TV offer about 2-vs.-2 team matches and more\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eBowser asks for the super show - with you as stage stars! Two teams compete against each other in a series of fun mini-games controlled by sound and movement\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eExperience 20 new mini games with the mouse mode of the Joy-Con 2, HD Vibration 2 and the microphone integrated in the console\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eSome mini games can also be used with a compatible USB-C camera (sold separately). Experience the feeling as if you are all playing in the same room, even if you are far away from each other\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eGames Super Mario Party Jamboree with improved graphics and frame rate on Nintendo Switch 2\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e","brand":"Nintendo","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":47456701317342,"sku":null,"price":60.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0272\/9476\/1037\/files\/rn-image_picker_lib_temp_9bb99cc2-32a4-4e2c-9faf-6ac455e20879.jpg?v=1755551737"},{"product_id":"puyo-puyo-tetris-2s-nintendo-switch-2","title":"Puyo Puyo Tetris 2S - Nintendo Switch 2","description":"\u003cdiv class=\"a-cardui feature\" data-a-card-type=\"basic\" name=\"a-cardui-deck-autoname-5-card1\" data-cel-widget=\"\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"aplus_feature_div\" data-feature-name=\"aplus\" data-template-name=\"aplus\" class=\"a-section a-spacing-none\"\u003e\n\u003ch3 class=\"hoc-feature-heading\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"0\" src=\"https: