y enhanced dimension of puzzle challenge when the world-renowned Tetris and Japan's beloved Puyo Puyo series blend their legendary gameplay together!\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e","brand":"SEGA","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":47456706199774,"sku":null,"price":50.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0272\/9476\/1037\/files\/rn-image_picker_lib_temp_2388e150-86a0-49c1-9476-510352ba6ef1.jpg?v=1755552272"},{"product_id":"kirby-and-the-forgotten-land-nintendo-switch-2-edition-star-crossed-world","title":"Kirby and the Forgotten Land - Nintendo Switch  2 Edition + Star-Crossed World","description":"","brand":"Nintendo","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":47493499945182,"sku":null,"price":60.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0272\/9476\/1037\/files\/rn-image_picker_lib_temp_a89cf0a0-0bf9-4361-a1b3-5311ae728729.jpg?v=1756792236"},{"product_id":"nba-2k26-nintendo-switch-2","title":"NBA 2K26 - Nintendo Switch 2","description":"\u003cdiv class=\"a-cardui feature\" data-a-card-type=\"basic\" name=\"a-cardui-deck-autoname-3-card1\" data-cel-widget=\"\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"aplus_feature_div\" data-feature-name=\"aplus\" data-template-name=\"aplus\" class=\"a-section a-spacing-none\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"a-cardui-deck dp-widget-card-deck celwidget\" data-a-remove-top-gutter=\"\" data-a-remove-bottom-gutter=\"\" data-csa-c-id=\"1ylryj-8jz8lf-rruepx-e7usut\" name=\"a-cardui-deck-autoname-4\" data-cel-widget=\"\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"a-cardui feature\" data-a-card-type=\"basic\" name=\"a-cardui-deck-autoname-3-card2\" data-cel-widget=\"\"\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"Powered\" src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/644805b3-d128-4335-97f5-670640eefdce.__CR0,0,970,300_PT0_SX970_V1___.png\" class=\"a-spacing-mini\" data-src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/644805b3-d128-4335-97f5-670640eefdce.__CR0,0,970,300_PT0_SX970_V1___.png\"\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"aplus-v2 mobile celwidget\" cel_widget_id=\"m-aplus\" data-csa-c-id=\"r6tt2l-4tx0fs-vaqcn-t0plh3\" data-cel-widget=\"m-aplus\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"celwidget aplus-module module-12 aplus-standard\" cel_widget_id=\"aplus-m-module-12\" data-csa-c-id=\"e6xsuf-ugm6ik-mcy1us-nci5ny\" data-cel-widget=\"aplus-m-module-12\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"aplus-module-wrapper\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"a-section a-spacing-none a-text-center\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"Your\" src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/19380e2e-5acd-4672-af98-349268ae3bb4.__CR0,0,970,300_PT0_SX970_V1___.png\" class=\"a-spacing-mini\" data-src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/19380e2e-5acd-4672-af98-349268ae3bb4.__CR0,0,970,300_PT0_SX970_V1___.png\"\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"celwidget aplus-module module-12 aplus-standard\" cel_widget_id=\"aplus-m-module-12\" data-csa-c-id=\"a30vgh-w2rlyx-k88fcz-psb2s0\" data-cel-widget=\"aplus-m-module-12\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"aplus-module-wrapper\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"a-section a-spacing-none a-text-center\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"Unite\" src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/d3d8847d-8762-4655-8b0f-09bc39c802f5.__CR0,0,970,300_PT0_SX970_V1___.png\" class=\"a-spacing-mini\" data-src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/d3d8847d-8762-4655-8b0f-09bc39c802f5.__CR0,0,970,300_PT0_SX970_V1___.png\"\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"celwidget aplus-module module-12 aplus-standard\" cel_widget_id=\"aplus-m-module-12\" data-csa-c-id=\"wxt6f9-5y09s3-voppzv-vw3w7q\" data-cel-widget=\"aplus-m-module-12\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"aplus-module-wrapper\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"a-section a-spacing-none a-text-center\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"Squad\" src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/5160e179-fb8d-4873-8a55-8631cfb5c64b.__CR0,0,970,300_PT0_SX970_V1___.png\" class=\"a-spacing-mini\" data-src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/5160e179-fb8d-4873-8a55-8631cfb5c64b.__CR0,0,970,300_PT0_SX970_V1___.png\"\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"a-cardui feature\" data-a-card-type=\"basic\" name=\"a-cardui-deck-autoname-3-card3\" data-cel-widget=\"\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"productDescription_feature_div\" data-feature-name=\"productDescription\" data-template-name=\"productDescription\" class=\"a-section a-spacing-none\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"productDescription_fullView\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"a-section text-direction-override\" dir=\"auto\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eBragging rights are on the line in MyCAREER*, MyTEAM, MyNBA, The W, and Play Now—leave no doubt that you wear the crown. *Internet connection and NBA 2K Account required to redeem and use bonus content. Terms apply. Play Now, MyNBA, and The W are available offline. All other game modes and features require Internet connection and may require online account registration (varies 13+).\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e","brand":"2k","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":47499690344670,"sku":null,"price":35.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0272\/9476\/1037\/files\/rn-image_picker_lib_temp_7b9f2813-3c5c-47ad-b8a7-1f51f2af1b75.jpg?v=1756978298"},{"product_id":"star-wars-outlaws-gold-edition-nintendo-switch-2","title":"Star Wars Outlaws - Gold Edition, Nintendo Switch 2","description":"\u003ch3\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"Star Wars Outlaws\" src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/bb3469bc-a865-49c0-99a2-53a7058a7eba.__CR0,0,970,600_PT0_SX970_V1___.jpg\" class=\"a-spacing-base\" data-src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/bb3469bc-a865-49c0-99a2-53a7058a7eba.__CR0,0,970,600_PT0_SX970_V1___.jpg\"\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"aplus-v2 mobile celwidget\" cel_widget_id=\"m-aplus\" data-csa-c-id=\"ct5i7m-wtw5hn-u1kmx-d3x29i\" data-cel-widget=\"m-aplus\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"celwidget aplus-module 3p-module-b aplus-standard\" cel_widget_id=\"aplus-m-3p-module-b\" data-csa-c-id=\"vzpo3k-z6mz7e-qc5cw-clvb6n\" data-cel-widget=\"aplus-m-3p-module-b\"\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"a-spacing-base\"\u003eExperience the first-ever open world Star Wars action-adventure game and explore distinct locations across the galaxy, both iconic and new. Risk it all as scoundrel Kay Vess, seeking freedom and the means to start a new life. Fight, steal, and outwit your way through the galaxy’s crime syndicates as you join the galaxy’s most wanted.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"a-spacing-base\"\u003eIf you’re willing to take the risk, the galaxy is full of opportunity.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"celwidget aplus-module 3p-module-b aplus-standard\" cel_widget_id=\"aplus-m-3p-module-b\" data-csa-c-id=\"az1qmq-58ud6a-n7kslr-s9kvns\" data-cel-widget=\"aplus-m-3p-module-b\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"aplus-3p-center-content\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"Galaxy of opportunity\" src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/0773f99f-a504-4eb0-8190-c981ce474f51.__CR0,0,970,600_PT0_SX970_V1___.jpg\" class=\"a-spacing-base\" data-src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/0773f99f-a504-4eb0-8190-c981ce474f51.__CR0,0,970,600_PT0_SX970_V1___.jpg\"\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003ch3 class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003eDISCOVER A GALAXY OF OPPORTUNITY\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"a-spacing-base\"\u003eExplore distinct locations with bustling cities and cantinas. Each location brings new adventures, unique challenges, and enticing rewards if you’re willing to take the risk.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"celwidget aplus-module module-9 aplus-standard\" cel_widget_id=\"aplus-m-module-9\" data-csa-c-id=\"x8wrjy-oegjn7-bhyinh-iswf3u\" data-cel-widget=\"aplus-m-module-9\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"aplus-module-wrapper\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"\"\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"a-text-center\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"Scoundrel story\" src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/d5704956-8c1f-4d89-90eb-f1543d78423a.__CR0,0,400,400_PT0_SX300_V1___.jpg\" class=\"a-spacing-mini\" data-src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/d5704956-8c1f-4d89-90eb-f1543d78423a.__CR0,0,400,400_PT0_SX300_V1___.jpg\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4 class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003eAN ORIGINAL SCOUNDREL STORY\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"a-spacing-base\"\u003eLive the high-stakes lifestyle of an outlaw. Turn any situation to your advantage with Nix by your side: fight with your blaster, overcome enemies with stealth and gadgets.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"a-text-center\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"HIGH-STAKES MISSIONS\" src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/83d3dd5a-f210-48ea-a471-fc50d45a0bd1.__CR0,0,400,400_PT0_SX300_V1___.jpg\" class=\"a-spacing-mini\" data-src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/83d3dd5a-f210-48ea-a471-fc50d45a0bd1.__CR0,0,400,400_PT0_SX300_V1___.jpg\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4 class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003eEMBARK ON HIGH-STAKES MISSIONS\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"a-spacing-base\"\u003eTake on missions from the galaxy’s crime syndicates. Steal valuable goods, infiltrate secret locations, and outwit enemies. Every choice you make influences your ever-changing reputation.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"a-text-center\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"JUMP INTO THE PILOT SEAT\" src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/ac652dab-702d-4a5c-9d8f-1e496d7b7948.__CR0,0,400,400_PT0_SX300_V1___.jpg\" class=\"a-spacing-mini\" data-src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/ac652dab-702d-4a5c-9d8f-1e496d7b7948.__CR0,0,400,400_PT0_SX300_V1___.jpg\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4 class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003eJUMP INTO THE PILOT SEAT\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"a-spacing-base\"\u003ePilot your ship, the Trailblazer, as you engage in thrilling dogfights with the Empire and other foes.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"celwidget aplus-module 3p-module-b aplus-standard\" cel_widget_id=\"aplus-m-3p-module-b\" data-csa-c-id=\"6kpw55-q1e7f8-eipuz-ja4mcz\" data-cel-widget=\"aplus-m-3p-module-b\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"aplus-3p-center-content\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"Gold Edition\" src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/8eae6aa1-fd1c-4c4e-b28e-c0dd1cb4d973.__CR0,0,970,600_PT0_SX970_V1___.jpg\" class=\"a-spacing-base\" data-src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/8eae6aa1-fd1c-4c4e-b28e-c0dd1cb4d973.__CR0,0,970,600_PT0_SX970_V1___.jpg\"\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003ch3 class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003eGold Edition Content*\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"a-spacing-base\"\u003eWith the Star Wars Outlaws Gold Edition, get access to the base game and the season pass including:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"a-spacing-base\"\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul class=\"a-unordered-list a-vertical\"\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eStar Wars Outlaws: Wild Card story pack\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eStar Wars Outlaws: A Pirate's Fortune story pack\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eJabba's Gambit exclusive Day 1 mission\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eThe Kessel Runner character pack\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eThe Hunter's Legacy bundle\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eThe Cartel Ronin bundle\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"a-spacing-base\"\u003e*Offer subject to change. Content may be available for purchase and\/or as giveaway(s) separately at Ubisoft’s sole discretion at any time.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e","brand":"Ubisoft","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":47533945979102,"sku":null,"price":50.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0272\/9476\/1037\/files\/rn-image_picker_lib_temp_99ee13cb-1293-4aa9-bf35-3a6415be099e.jpg?v=1757805368"},{"product_id":"hori-piranha-plant-camera-for-nintendo-switch-2-officially-licensed-by-nintendo","title":"HORI Piranha Plant Camera for Nintendo Switch 2- Officially Licensed by Nintendo","description":"\u003ch3\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"NSX-001U A+1\" src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/ae709981-8725-4b14-8128-69a161c91994.__CR0,0,1940,1200_PT0_SX970_V1___.jpg\" class=\"a-spacing-base\" data-src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/ae709981-8725-4b14-8128-69a161c91994.__CR0,0,1940,1200_PT0_SX970_V1___.jpg\"\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"aplus-v2 mobile celwidget\" cel_widget_id=\"m-aplus\" data-csa-c-id=\"lm9saw-n01xf9-jtb4ni-ejuv23\" data-cel-widget=\"m-aplus\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"celwidget aplus-module 3p-module-b aplus-standard\" cel_widget_id=\"aplus-m-3p-module-b\" data-csa-c-id=\"b23xye-iqrn6g-75vf22-qwcl1m\" data-cel-widget=\"aplus-m-3p-module-b\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"aplus-3p-center-content\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"NSX-001U A+2\" src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/f65be5b4-3ff4-4e5d-afa2-30e87ab4f467.__CR0,0,1293,800_PT0_SX970_V1___.jpg\" class=\"a-spacing-base\" data-src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/f65be5b4-3ff4-4e5d-afa2-30e87ab4f467.__CR0,0,1293,800_PT0_SX970_V1___.jpg\"\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"a-spacing-base\"\u003eConnect to Nintendo Switch 2 system to enjoy video and voice chat while you play.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"a-spacing-base\"\u003e(*Internet, Nintendo Account and Nintendo Switch Online membership (sold separately) may be required for chat features.)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"celwidget aplus-module 3p-module-b aplus-standard\" cel_widget_id=\"aplus-m-3p-module-b\" data-csa-c-id=\"r74e6x-wklu3b-ai6wt8-n44q9l\" data-cel-widget=\"aplus-m-3p-module-b\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"aplus-3p-center-content\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"NSX-001U A+3\" src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/838912ce-2666-463d-9087-a29dd2319d25.__CR0,0,1293,800_PT0_SX970_V1___.jpg\" class=\"a-spacing-base\" data-src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/838912ce-2666-463d-9087-a29dd2319d25.__CR0,0,1293,800_PT0_SX970_V1___.jpg\"\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003ch3 class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003eShaped like the iconic Piranha Plant\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"a-spacing-base\"\u003eOpen and close the mouth to cover the camera lens. The flexible neck can be adjusted to find the perfect camera angle.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"celwidget aplus-module module-9 aplus-standard\" cel_widget_id=\"aplus-m-module-9\" data-csa-c-id=\"euezr9-hq22j3-1j20d-muge3\" data-cel-widget=\"aplus-m-module-9\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"aplus-module-wrapper\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"\"\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"a-text-center\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"NSX-001U A+4\" src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/b6cba58e-ad73-45dd-b27c-15eb9a82e91d.__CR0,0,600,600_PT0_SX300_V1___.jpg\" class=\"a-spacing-mini\" data-src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/b6cba58e-ad73-45dd-b27c-15eb9a82e91d.__CR0,0,600,600_PT0_SX300_V1___.jpg\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"a-spacing-base\"\u003eAttach to included base for TV mode \u0026amp; tabletop mode. Detach camera from the base for portable mode.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"a-text-center\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"NSX-001U A+5\" src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/107b4738-c792-4113-a7fa-54b8df100fd2.__CR0,0,600,600_PT0_SX300_V1___.jpg\" class=\"a-spacing-mini\" data-src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/107b4738-c792-4113-a7fa-54b8df100fd2.__CR0,0,600,600_PT0_SX300_V1___.jpg\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"a-spacing-base\"\u003eAttach directly to the Nintendo Switch 2 system for portable mode.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"a-text-center\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"NSX-001U A+6\" src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/e34c27a5-f500-4f19-91e8-08788d418a7c.__CR0,0,600,600_PT0_SX300_V1___.jpg\" class=\"a-spacing-mini\" data-src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/e34c27a5-f500-4f19-91e8-08788d418a7c.__CR0,0,600,600_PT0_SX300_V1___.jpg\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"a-spacing-base\"\u003eMount to the TV and enjoy playing with your friends on the big screen!\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/