-module module-12 aplus-standard\" cel_widget_id=\"aplus-m-module-12\" data-csa-c-id=\"qmjkj4-4r33wf-hmq80v-kbzp69\" data-cel-widget=\"aplus-m-module-12\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"aplus-module-wrapper\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"a-section a-spacing-none a-text-center\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"EA Sports FC, FC, FC 26, Football, Soccer, Bellingham, Madrid, Real, EA, Sports, Game\" src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/dd88e842-83bc-4e9f-9c61-56674eb42f3a.__CR0,0,1940,600_PT0_SX970_V1___.jpg\" class=\"a-spacing-mini\" data-src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/dd88e842-83bc-4e9f-9c61-56674eb42f3a.__CR0,0,1940,600_PT0_SX970_V1___.jpg\"\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"celwidget aplus-module module-12 aplus-standard\" cel_widget_id=\"aplus-m-module-12\" data-csa-c-id=\"vvvz0p-jkwoos-jb089v-o32ija\" data-cel-widget=\"aplus-m-module-12\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"aplus-module-wrapper\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"a-section a-spacing-none a-text-center\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"EA Sports FC, FC, FC 26, Football, Soccer, Bellingham, Madrid, Real, EA, Sports, Game\" src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/efb46473-0a94-4bfc-aead-718c9add0c9b.__CR0,0,1940,600_PT0_SX970_V1___.jpg\" class=\"a-spacing-mini\" data-src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/efb46473-0a94-4bfc-aead-718c9add0c9b.__CR0,0,1940,600_PT0_SX970_V1___.jpg\"\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"celwidget aplus-module module-12 aplus-standard\" cel_widget_id=\"aplus-m-module-12\" data-csa-c-id=\"n43vcv-m6ur8q-3ylt0n-xhavm5\" data-cel-widget=\"aplus-m-module-12\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"aplus-module-wrapper\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"a-section a-spacing-none a-text-center\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"EA Sports FC, FC, FC 26, Football, Soccer, Bellingham, Madrid, Real, EA, Sports, Game\" src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/d57dc8ec-9286-4160-8f4c-259b0b319342.__CR0,0,1940,600_PT0_SX970_V1___.jpg\" class=\"a-spacing-mini\" data-src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/d57dc8ec-9286-4160-8f4c-259b0b319342.__CR0,0,1940,600_PT0_SX970_V1___.jpg\"\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"celwidget aplus-module module-12 aplus-standard\" cel_widget_id=\"aplus-m-module-12\" data-csa-c-id=\"eyhw0-r2pwdu-jzlup9-28mmr8\" data-cel-widget=\"aplus-m-module-12\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"aplus-module-wrapper\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"a-section a-spacing-none a-text-center\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"EA Sports FC, FC, FC 26, Football, Soccer, Bellingham, Madrid, Real, EA, Sports, Game\" src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/55e15217-75c8-4b38-a10c-ef5db70988c5.__CR0,0,1940,600_PT0_SX970_V1___.jpg\" class=\"a-spacing-mini\" data-src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/55e15217-75c8-4b38-a10c-ef5db70988c5.__CR0,0,1940,600_PT0_SX970_V1___.jpg\"\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"a-cardui feature\" data-a-card-type=\"basic\" name=\"a-cardui-deck-autoname-3-card3\" data-cel-widget=\"\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"productDescription_feature_div\" data-feature-name=\"productDescription\" data-template-name=\"productDescription\" class=\"a-section a-spacing-none\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"productDescription_fullView\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"a-section text-direction-override\" dir=\"auto\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eThe Club is Yours in EA SPORTS FC™ 26. Play your way with an overhauled gameplay experience powered by feedback from the FC Community. The new Authentic Gameplay preset delivers our most true-to-football experience ever in Career, while the Competitive Gameplay preset—driven by refined fundamentals, added consistency, and enhanced responsiveness—is tailor-made for play in Football Ultimate Team™ and Clubs. Put your dream squad to the test in Football Ultimate Team™ with Tournaments and Live Events, as well as a refreshed Rivals and Champs experience. Tournaments will test your skills with up to four rounds of knockout football, while Live Events add more variety with themed competitions and content all season long. New Bounties allow you to earn additional rewards or accelerate your weekly progress. Additionally, EA SPORTS FC™ 26 launches a new second-tier weekend competition, Challengers, designed for players in lower Divisions. Experience Manager Career like never before with all-new Manager Live Challenges. Take on a variety of real-world scenarios and alternative storylines throughout the new season—ranging from a few minutes of play to multiple seasons—and earn rewards including Season Points, Vanity, and ICONs and Heroes to use in modern-day clubs. Additionally, for the first time ever, movement in the Manager Market sees team tactics transform over time as new managers take the helm, changing the dynamics of every new season. Plus, experience unexpected events throughout your Career, managing short and long-term matters which shape the future of your club. Archetypes inspired by greats of the game introduce new classes to Clubs and Player Career, bringing even more individuality to your player customisation and progression. Develop your abilities throughout the season by upgrading attributes and unlocking new Archetype Perks to give your player a distinct feel on the pitch. Play solo or with Clubmates in Clubs Rush Live Events, introducing a range of exciting new knockout Tournaments to Clubs in EA SPORTS FC™ 26. With varying entry requirements and gameplay rules, Tournaments deliver fresh experiences with new objectives and exciting rewards throughout the season—connecting Clubs to ongoing campaigns across EA SPORTS FC™ 26. Experience unrivalled authenticity in EA SPORTS FC™ 26, featuring 20,000+ players across 750+ clubs and national teams, in over 120+ stadiums and 35+ leagues. EA SPORTS FC™ 26 is the only place you can play the iconic UEFA Champions League, UEFA Europa League, UEFA Europa Conference League, CONMEBOL Libertadores, Premier League, Bundesliga, and LALIGA EA SPORTS in the same game, alongside the Google Pixel Frauen-Bundesliga, Liga F Moeve, Barclays Women’s Super League, Arkema Premiere Ligue, National Women's Soccer League, and the UEFA Women's Champions League.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"a-cardui feature\" data-a-card-type=\"basic\" name=\"a-cardui-deck-autoname-3-card4\" data-cel-widget=\"\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"featureBulletsAndDetailBullets_feature_div\" data-feature-name=\"featureBulletsAndDetailBullets\" data-template-name=\"featureBulletsAndDetailBullets\" class=\"a-section a-spacing-none\"\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eFeatures \u0026amp; details\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"featurebullets_secondary_view_div\" class=\"a-section\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"feature-bullets\" class=\"a-section a-spacing-small featureBulletsDiv\"\u003e\n\u003cul class=\"a-unordered-list a-vertical a-spacing-none\"\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eThis video game is the world's leading football game; The Standard Edition contains the EA SPORTS FC 26 full game\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eThe Club is Yours in EA SPORTS FC 26.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003ePlay your way with an overhauled gameplay experience powered by feedback from the FC Community.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eExperience Manager Career like never before with all-new Manager Live Challenges.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003ePut your dream squad to the test in Football Ultimate Team with Tournaments and Live Events, as well as a refreshed Rivals and Champs experience.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e","brand":"Electronic Arts","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":47553158152414,"sku":null,"price":30.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0272\/9476\/1037\/files\/rn-image_picker_lib_temp_9435c0b3-a103-43ac-8427-0307e860ec1b.jpg?v=1758660558"},{"product_id":"little-nightmares-iii-nintendo-switch-2","title":"Little Nightmares III - Nintendo Switch 2","description":"\u003cdiv class=\"a-cardui feature\" data-a-card-type=\"basic\" name=\"a-cardui-deck-autoname-5-card1\" data-cel-widget=\"\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"aplus_feature_div\" data-feature-name=\"aplus\" data-template-name=\"aplus\" class=\"a-section a-spacing-none\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"a-cardui-deck dp-widget-card-deck celwidget\" data-a-remove-top-gutter=\"\" data-a-remove-bottom-gutter=\"\" name=\"a-cardui-deck-autoname-6\" data-csa-c-id=\"syqgzo-wpyuqn-4gk10b-l687u6\" data-cel-widget=\"\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"a-cardui feature\" data-a-card-type=\"basic\" name=\"a-cardui-deck-autoname-5-card2\" data-cel-widget=\"\"\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"Little Nightmares III\" src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/ca2b3daa-053c-4b40-9719-2293ac9bc84f.__CR0,0,970,600_PT0_SX970_V1___.jpg\" class=\"a-spacing-base\" data-src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/ca2b3daa-053c-4b40-9719-2293ac9bc84f.__CR0,0,970,600_PT0_SX970_V1___.jpg\"\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"aplus-v2 mobile celwidget\" cel_widget_id=\"m-aplus\" data-csa-c-id=\"t3lxue-rniu0j-a5h19e-t3yl1g\" data-cel-widget=\"m-aplus\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"celwidget aplus-module 3p-module-b aplus-standard\" cel_widget_id=\"aplus-m-3p-module-b\" data-csa-c-id=\"so3nu3-ksbymd-c0mbkf-go9wvx\" data-cel-widget=\"aplus-m-3p-module-b\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"aplus-3p-center-content\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"Little Nightmares III\" src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/f5209cfb-362e-49d6-ac7c-f98dbb52fdbb.__CR0,0,970,600_PT0_SX970_V1___.jpg\" class=\"a-spacing-base\" data-src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/f5209cfb-362e-49d6-ac7c-f98dbb52fdbb.__CR0,0,970,600_PT0_SX970_V1___.jpg\"\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"celwidget aplus-module 3p-module-b aplus-standard\" cel_widget_id=\"aplus-m-3p-module-b\" data-csa-c-id=\"iwjzja-jmp5dw-7b7yz4-v5gbq0\" data-cel-widget=\"aplus-m-3p-module-b\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"aplus-3p-center-content\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"Little Nightmares III\" src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/3905ff78-0115-4271-bbfe-472c7b8ccb84.__CR0,0,970,600_PT0_SX970_V1___.jpg\" class=\"a-spacing-base\" data-src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/3905ff78-0115-4271-bbfe-472c7b8ccb84.__CR0,0,970,600_PT0_SX970_V1___.jpg\"\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"celwidget aplus-module 3p-module-b aplus-standard\" cel_widget_id=\"aplus-m-3p-module-b\" data-csa-c-id=\"pj6dn7-9nqase-j6ubgn-ux1n1s\" data-cel-widget=\"aplus-m-3p-module-b\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"aplus-3p-center-content\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"Little Nightmares III\" src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/60eb311d-fad0-4fb1-8ba1-ee98c2cd03e9.__CR0,0,970,600_PT0_SX970_V1___.jpg\" class=\"a-spacing-base\" data-src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/60eb311d-fad0-4fb1-8ba1-ee98c2cd03e9.__CR0,0,970,600_PT0_SX970_V1___.jpg\"\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"a-cardui feature\" data-a-card-type=\"basic\" name=\"a-cardui-deck-autoname-5-card3\" data-cel-widget=\"\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"productDescription_feature_div\" data-feature-name=\"productDescription\" data-template-name=\"productDescription\" class=\"a-section a-spacing-none\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"productDescription_fullView\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"a-section text-direction-override\" dir=\"auto\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eEmbark on a new adventure in the unique world of Little Nightmares. In Little Nightmares III, you’ll guide Low \u0026amp; Alone as they search for a path that could lead them out of the Nowhere.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eFACE YOUR CHILDHOOD FEARS TOGETHER with a friend using online co-op, or solo with an AI companion. Choose from two brand-new characters, each equipped with their own iconic items. Play solo with an ai or with your friend using online co-op and work together to solve intricate puzzles and defend yourself against smaller enemies.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eNAVIGATE THROUGH A BRAND-NEW WORLD OF DELUSIONS. Embark on an adventure through the Spiral, a cluster of dystopian lands. Discover places as diverse as the mysterious desert of Necropolis, an unsettling fun fair, a gloomy factory, and who knows what else. Run away from a new cast of foes ranging from ominous beetles to a giant baby, and so many more.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eFOLLOW THE JOURNEY OF LOW \u0026amp; ALONE. Meet Low and Alone and learn more about the boy in the raven mask and the girl with pigtails. Guide the two friends through a menacing world as they search for a way out of the Nowhere\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"a-cardui feature\" data-a-card-type=\"basic\" name=\"a-cardui-deck-autoname-5-card4\" data-cel-widget=\"\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"featureBulletsAndDetailBullets_feature_div\" data-feature-name=\"featureBulletsAndDetailBullets\" data-template-name=\"featureBulletsAndDetailBullets\" class=\"a-section a-spacing-none\"\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eFeatures \u0026amp; details\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"featurebullets_secondary_view_div\" class=\"a-section\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"feature-bullets\" class=\"a-section a-spacing-small featureBulletsDiv\"\u003e\n\u003cul class=\"a-unordered-list a-vertical a-spacing-none\"\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eIn Little Nightmares III, you’ll guide Low \u0026amp; Alone as they search for a path that could lead them out of the Nowhere\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eFace your childhood fears together with a friend using online co-op, or solo with an AI companion\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eNavigate through a brand new world of delusions\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eNever Face Your Childhood Fears Alone\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e","brand":"BANDAI NAMCO Entertainment","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":47605661204702,"sku":null,"price":35.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0272\/9476\/1037\/files\/rn-image_picker_lib_temp_7ee562eb-1c9b-4eb3-bd07-c93c8934e06f.jpg?v=1760563938"},{"product_id":"pokemon-legends-z-a-nintendo-switch-2","title":"Pokémon Legends: Z-A – Nintendo Switch 2 Edition","description":"\u003cul class=\"a-unordered-list a-vertical a-spacing-none\"\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eLive the life of a Pokémon Trainer in the streets of Lumiose City!\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eFor the first time in the Pokémon RPG series, command your Pokémon in real-time battles\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eUse the power of Mega Evolution in battle and take on rampaging Rogue Mega-Evolved Pokémon\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eCompete in the Z-A Royale each night to test your skills and try to become the strongest Pokémon Trainer\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eVisit shops, restaurants, and places called wild zones—where Pokémon roam free—all centered around Prism Tower\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eMeet all kinds of interesting characters on your journey—including AZ, the enigmatic owner of Hotel Z, and Team MZ, the crew that aims to keep Lumiose a peaceful place\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Nintendo","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":47619184754910,"sku":null,"price":55.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0272\/9476\/1037\/files\/rn-image_picker_lib_temp_5486b71e-1f0a-4f7b-b0de-cfeaed03a3e4.jpg?v=1760910391"},{"product_id":"dobe-crystal-case-for-nintendo-switch-2","title":"Dobe Crystal Case for Nintendo Switch 2","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eThe Crystal Clear Protection case for the Switch 2 is crafted from high-quality transparent PC material, showcasing the console's original beauty while offering comprehensive protection. It effectively guards against scratches, impacts, and accidental drops, ensuring your device remains in pristine condition. With a stylish clear design, it allows the Switch 2's aesthetic to shine through, adding a touch of modern elegance. Its durable construction is resistant to wear and aging, maintaining clarity and integrity over time. Specifically designed for the Switch 2, it provides a precise fit and ensures full access to all buttons and ports for seamless operation. Additionally, integrated slots offer convenient storage and organization for your game cards\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Dobe","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":47632245686494,"sku":null,"price":10.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0272\/9476\/1037\/files\/rn-image_picker_lib_temp_23c24a39-9edd-4cae-a0c9-3992d5ef05ae.jpg?v=1761499660"},{"product_id":"hyrule-warriors-age-of-imprisonment-nintendo-switch-2","title":"Hyrule Warriors: Age of Imprisonment - Nintendo Switch 2","description":"\u003cdiv class=\"flex text-body-40 text-grey-900\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eFight alongside new and familiar heroes to defend Hyrule from the Demon King\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"flex text-body-40 text-grey-900\"\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"rounded-full min-w-[5px] min-h-[5px] w-[5px] h-[5px] bg-blue-400 mr-2 mt-2\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003ePrincess Zelda is not alone in this war! Join Mineru, the Sages, and even some brand-new heroes in battles against Ganondorf’s forces.\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"flex text-body-40 text-grey-900\"\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"rounded-full min-w-[5px] min-h-[5px] w-[5px] h-[5px] bg-blue-400 mr-2 mt-2\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003eCombine powerful Zonai Devices with your heroes’ signature abilities to take down powerful bosses and their legions of minions.\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"flex text-body-40 text-grey-900\"\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"rounded-full min-w-[5px] min-h-[5px] w-[5px] h-[5px] bg-blue-400 mr-2 mt-2\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003eTeam up with a friend in two-player local co-op via split screen or GameShare\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"flex text-body-40 text-grey-900\"\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"rounded-full min-w-[5px] min-h-[5px] w-[5px] h-[5px] bg-blue-400 mr-2 mt-2\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003eJoin up with a friend for two-player local co-op, and you can spread out to cover more ground as the war unfolds—or stick together and combine your powers to smash the opposition.\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"flex text-body-40 text-grey-900\"\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"rounded-full min-w-[5px] min-h-[5px] w-[5px] h-[5px] bg-blue-400 mr-2 mt-2\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003ePlay split-screen on a single console, or on two separate consoles via GameShare*—either way, only one person needs to have the game.\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e","brand":"Nintendo","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":47670630023390,"sku":null,"price":60.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0272\/9476\/1037\/files\/rn-image_picker_lib_temp_30f1e729-4072-448f-ba23-ca6f11ebb3ca.jpg?v=1762903290"},{"product_id":"nintendo-switch-2-all-in-one-carrying-case","title":"Nintendo Switch 2 All InOne Carrying Case","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eThis case can store and carry all equipment needed to play in TV mode, including the Nintendo Switch  2 console, Nintendo Switch 2 Doc, Joy-Con 2 controllers, and various cables. It can also store Game Cards.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eComplete Storage Solution:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003eThis package comes with a handy carrying case, everything you need to keep your Nintendo Switch™ 2 system safe and ready for transport.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eTV Mode Ready:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003eIt’s designed to fit your Nintendo Switch™ 2 console, the Nintendo Switch™ 2 Dock, Joy-Con™ 2 controllers, various cables, and even up to six Game Cards. Basically, it’s everything you need for gaming on the big screen while you’re on the move.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eSecure \u0026amp; Compact:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003eWith dedicated compartments for each accessory, you can keep all your gear organized and secure, making your travel experience a breeze without the clutter.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eConvenient \u0026amp; Portable:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003eIt’s lightweight and super easy to carry, making it perfect for gaming on the go while keeping your equipment organized and safe.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"iPlay","offers":[{"title":"Black","offer_id":48369895899358,"sku":null,"price":20.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true},{"title":"Blue","offer_id":48369895932126,"sku":null,"price":20.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true},{"title":"Red","offer_id":48369895964894,"sku":null,"price":20.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0272\/9476\/1037\/files\/rn-image_picker_lib_temp_cc9e0985-c651-41bb-b895-05f6f48360aa.jpg?v=1763077430"},{"product_id":"hard-carrying-case-for-nintendo-switch-2-with-storage-pockets-for-tv-dock-charger-games-controllers","title":"Hard Carrying Case For Nintendo Switch 2 With Storage Pockets for TV Dock, Charger, Games \u0026 Controllers","description":"\u003cp\u003eProtective case designed for Nintendo Switch 2. This hard shell case combines durable EVA and PU materials to provide scratch-resistant, dust-proof, and splash-resistant protection. The 1:1 precision molding ensures a perfect fit without affecting joystick functionality. Features include a built-in charging dock (requires separate charger), storage compartments for TV Dock, Pro controllers, Joycon, HDMI cables, and a removable stand for tabletop gaming. The interior soft lining prevents screen scratches while the ergonomic design offers a comfortable grip. Compact yet spacious, it accommodates the console and all accessories for easy travel.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMaterial: PU + EVA. Compatible with Nintendo Switch 2. Dimensions: 330×160×110mm (12.99×6.3×4.33 inches).\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"iPega","offers":[{"title":"Standard Black","offer_id":47709453320414,"sku":null,"price":15.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true},{"title":"Zelda Edition","offer_id":47709453353182,"sku":null,"price":15.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true},{"title":"Mario Edition With M Logo","offer_id":47709453385950,"sku":null,"price":15.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true},{"title":"Mario Edition","offer_id":47709453418718,"sku":null,"price":15.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0272\/9476\/1037\/files\/rn-image_picker_lib_temp_7908c618-b445-4a79-b4f3-8af953e8e50c.jpg?v=1763969621"},{"product_id":"dobe-tns-31113-wall-mount-bracket-for-nintendo-switch-2-switch-oled-game-controller-hanger-with-game-card-storage","title":"DOBE TNS-31113 Wall Mount Bracket for Nintendo Switch 2 \/ Switch \/ OLED Game Controller Hanger with Game Card Storage","description":"\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e【Universal Compatibility】Designed for Switch 2, Switch, and Switch OLED console models, providing wall-mounting options.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e【Sturdy Construction】Crafted from a durable combination of iron and ABS plastic, ensuring long-lasting stability and support.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e【Space-Saving Design】Wall-mounted bracket efficiently organizes your gaming setup, freeing up valuable surface space.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e【Integrated Game Card Storage】Features built-in storage for game cards, keeping your gaming essentials neatly organized and easily accessible.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e【Controller Hanging Functionality】Includes dedicated spaces for hanging controllers, providing a complete storage solution for your gaming accessories.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Dobe","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":47709480288478,"sku":null,"price":15.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0272\/9476\/1037\/files\/rn-image_picker_lib_temp_24c193e5-0a90-4660-b988-ee6314f6b6cd.jpg?v=1764114086"},{"product_id":"dobe-charging-grip-for-nintendo-switch-2-joy-pad","title":"Dobe Charging Grip for Nintendo Switch 2 Joy-Pad - TNS-3177","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eThe Dobe TNS-3177 Charging Grip for Nintendo Switch 2 Joy-Con (Black) is a sleek and ergonomic accessory designed for comfort and convenience. It features a secure magnetic locking system that keeps both Joy-Con controllers firmly in place, preventing accidental slips during intense gameplay. The curved grip fits naturally in the hands, reducing fatigue during long sessions, while its dual-charging capability allows both Joy-Con to recharge simultaneously through a USB-C connection. LED indicators provide clear charging status—red while charging and green when fully powered or on standby—so you always know when your controllers are ready. Built with durable, flame-retardant ABS material and equipped with intelligent safety circuitry, the grip is both reliable and portable. Its play-while-charging function makes it ideal for extended gaming marathons, combining comfort, security, and practicality in one essential accessory.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Dobe","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":47709527408862,"sku":null,"price":12.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0272\/9476\/1037\/files\/rn-image_picker_lib_temp_ef6b8a54-7030-43da-972b-a05548aaa8bd.jpg?v=1764115136"},{"product_id":"dobe-controller-grip-for-nintendo-switch-2-joy-pad-black-tns-3177b","title":"Dobe Controller Grip for Nintendo Switch 2 Joy-Pad (Black) TNS-3177B","description":"\u003ch2\u003e\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"font-weight: 400;\" data-start=\"67\" data-end=\"141\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"67\" data-end=\"139\"\u003eDobe Controller Grip for Nintendo Switch 2 Joy-Pad (Black) TNS-3177B\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/b\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"font-weight: 400;\" data-start=\"143\" data-end=\"400\"\u003eEnhance your Nintendo Switch 2 gaming experience with the\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"201\" data-end=\"235\"\u003eDobe Controller Grip TNS-3177B\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/b\u003e. Designed for comfort and stability, this grip transforms your Joy-Pads into a more traditional controller layout, making it easier to enjoy long gaming sessions.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"font-weight: 400;\" data-start=\"402\" data-end=\"421\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"402\" data-end=\"419\"\u003eKey Features:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/b\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul style=\"font-weight: 400;\" data-start=\"422\" data-end=\"893\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"422\" data-end=\"520\"\u003e\n\u003cb\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"424\" data-end=\"444\"\u003eErgonomic Design\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/b\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e– Provides a comfortable grip, reducing hand strain during extended play.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"521\" data-end=\"613\"\u003e\n\u003cb\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"523\" data-end=\"538\"\u003ePrecise Fit\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/b\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e– Securely holds your Joy-Pads, ensuring stability and accurate control.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"614\" data-end=\"719\"\u003e\n\u003cb\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"616\" data-end=\"647\"\u003eTraditional Controller Feel\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/b\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e– Turns your Joy-Pads into a gamepad-like design for better handling.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"720\" data-end=\"801\"\u003e\n\u003cb\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"722\" data-end=\"739\"\u003eDurable Build\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/b\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e– Made with high-quality ABS material for long-lasting use.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"802\" data-end=\"893\"\u003e\n\u003cb\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"804\" data-end=\"830\"\u003ePortable \u0026amp; Lightweight\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/b\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e– Easy to carry and perfect for gaming at home or on the go.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"font-weight: 400;\" data-start=\"895\" data-end=\"915\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"895\" data-end=\"913\"\u003eCompatibility:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/b\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul style=\"font-weight: 400;\" data-start=\"916\" data-end=\"974\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"916\" data-end=\"974\"\u003eSpecially designed for\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"941\" data-end=\"971\"\u003eNintendo Switch 2 Joy-Pads\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/b\u003e.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"font-weight: 400;\" data-start=\"976\" data-end=\"1017\"\u003eColor:\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"983\" data-end=\"992\"\u003eBlack\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/b\u003e\u003cbr data-start=\"992\" data-end=\"995\"\u003eModel:\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1002\" data-end=\"1015\"\u003eTNS-3177B\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/b\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Dobe","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":47709532422366,"sku":null,"price":8.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0272\/9476\/1037\/files\/rn-image_picker_lib_temp_90047e38-c184-4725-abde-24cd929471a7.jpg?v=1764115383"},{"product_id":"dobe-controller-grip-full-circle-steering-wheel-kit-for-nintendo-switch-2-joy-pad","title":"Dobe Controller Grip \u0026 Full-Circle Steering Wheel Kit for Nintendo Switch 2 Joy-Pad","description":"\u003cp\u003eUpgrade your Nintendo Switch 2 gaming experience with the\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"261\" data-end=\"327\"\u003eDobe TNS-5110 Controller Grip \u0026amp; Full-Circle Steering Wheel Kit\u003c\/strong\u003e. This 4-in-1 accessory set is designed to enhance comfort and immersion during gameplay. It includes two ergonomic controller grips for better handling in action and fighting games, and a full-circle steering wheel attachment for realistic racing game control. Crafted from durable ABS plastic, each piece ensures a snug, secure fit for your Joy-Con controllers while maintaining lightweight portability. Perfect for solo or multiplayer sessions, this kit transforms your Joy-Cons into versatile, game-specific tools for a more enjoyable play experience.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCompatibility: Designed for Switch 2 Joy-Con controllers—fits both left and right Joy-Con modules perfectly \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eKey Features\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSecure \u0026amp; Stable Fit: Precision‑molded to snap Joy-Con controllers firmly—no wobbling or looseness during gameplay \u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eQuick Mode-Switching: Easily switch between wheel and grip modes to match the gaming genre; perfect for racing and action titles alike \u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eErgonomic \u0026amp; Comfortable: Curved grips designed for prolonged gaming—relieves fatigue and provides a natural hand fit \u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLightweight \u0026amp; Portable: Made from high-strength ABS plastic that’s sturdy yet lightweight—great for on-the-go gaming \u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Dobe","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":47709536092382,"sku":null,"price":10.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0272\/9476\/1037\/files\/rn-image_picker_lib_temp_3718a103-3e34-457c-b91b-363f2c94ffdc.jpg?v=1764115847"},{"product_id":"oivo-charging-dock-for-nintendo-switch-2-joy-con","title":"OIVO Charging Dock for Nintendo Switch 2 Joy-Con","description":"\u003cp\u003eIts sleek black finish blends seamlessly with your Switch 2 setup, while the stable base ensures your controllers stay secure during charging. Perfect for gamers who want both functionality and organization, the OIVO Charging Dock is lightweight, durable, and powered via USB, making it easy to connect directly to your console, dock, or any USB adapter.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003eMaterial: ABS\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003eConnector Type: Magnetic\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003eCompatible with: Nintendo Switch 2\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003eSupports charging up to four controllers simultaneously\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003eMagnetic alignment for easy attachment of controllers\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"OIVO","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":47709537927390,"sku":null,"price":12.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0272\/9476\/1037\/files\/rn-image_picker_lib_temp_30e96719-7b75-4ca9-8c31-e17e2bed836c.jpg?v=1764116057"}],"url":"https:\/\/www.gamers-stop.com\/collections\/nintendo-switch-2.oembed","provider":"Gamers Stop","version":"1.0","type":"link"}